01 (AI-Researcher) patch for the shared file automation/scripts/generate_topic2_native_inputs.py
Applied at run time by real_eval/adapters/shared_layer_overlay.py; the shared file itself
stays byte-identical to upstream.

AI-Researcher rendering only (consumed by MountainCar through
real_eval/adapters/mountaincar_continuous/generate_native_inputs.py and by the 01 topic2 wrappers):
  * metaprompt EVALUATION: the experiment_trace.json top-level key schema the delivery gate checks
  * metaprompt REF: the contract and execution budget are readable at /workspace/automation/
    (the host path upstream prints is not reachable from the container)
